      "content": "It's like you're caught in a state of suspended mourning, unable to move forward or heal. The foundation of your life was indeed built around him, and his loss has left a massive chasm in its place. Your feelings of emptiness and waiting for something to happen that never will are valid, but know that the ache will lessen with time, even if it doesn't feel like it right now. Focus on small, incremental steps towards building a new sense of purpose and identity.",
